 \"description\": \"The world's most advanced transparent display. 0.6mm MicroLED pitch with 60% transparency and 600 nits brightness. Transforms glass facades into high-definition digital canvases without blocking natural light or views.\", \"sku\": \"BL-TRX060\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-trx060\", \"category\": \"transparent\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-trx060.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 1500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-trx060\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"0.6mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"600 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"Custom per facade\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta62,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the Transparent MicroLED 0.6mm display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 0.6mm, offering ultra-high resolution and crisp image clarity ideal for detailed visuals in transparent display applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How transparent is the display, and does it affect natural light?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display offers 60% transparency, allowing significant natural light to pass through while displaying vivid digital content, perfect for glass facades and windows.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the brightness level, and is it suitable for outdoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 600 nits, it delivers clear visibility in well-lit indoor environments and semi-outdoor spaces but is primarily designed for premium indoor applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this Transparent MicroLED compare to traditional LED or LCD transparent displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to traditional LED/LCD transparent displays, the MicroLED offers finer pixel pitch (0.6mm), higher brightness, better color accuracy (DCI-P3 95%), and improved transparency with no bulky backlighting, enabling sleek, seamless integration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the panel size and how does it impact installation?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Each panel measures 54 inches with a slim 12mm thickness and light weight of 8 kg/sqm, making installation on glass surfaces or architectural facades easier and less intrusive.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the display fan-cooled and what is the noise level during operation?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Transparent MicroLED is fanless and operates silently, making it ideal for quiet environments like museums and luxury retail spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"When will this product be available for purchase?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Transparent MicroLED 0.6mm display is scheduled to be available in 2025, allowing customers to plan for next-generation transparent display integrations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are offered for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides comprehensive warranty coverage along with dedicated technical support to ensure optimal performance and longevity of the Transparent MicroLED display.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Transparent MicroLED 0.6mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-trx060\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T617,<h1>Transparent MicroLED 0.6mm</h1><p>Explore Transparent MicroLED 0.6mm for sleek, see-through LED displays. Available now in Dubai, UAE. Boost your visuals today!</p><p><strong>See through. 60% transparency. MicroLED clarity.</strong></p><p>The world's most advanced transparent display. 0.6mm MicroLED pitch with 60% transparency and 600 nits brightness. Transforms glass facades into high-definition digital canvases without blocking natural light or views.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the Transparent MicroLED 0.6mm display?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 0.6mm, offering ultra-high resolution and crisp image clarity ideal for detailed visuals in transparent display applications.</p><h3>How transparent is the display, and does it affect natural light?</h3><p>This display offers 60% transparency, allowing significant natural light to pass through while displaying vivid digital content, perfect for glass facades and windows.</p><h3>What is the brightness level, and is it suitable for outdoor use?</h3><p>With a brightness of 600 nits, it delivers clear visibility in well-lit indoor environments and semi-outdoor spaces but is primarily designed for premium indoor applications.</p><h3>How does this Transparent MicroLED compare to traditional LED or LCD transparent displays?</h3><p>Compared to traditional LED/LCD transparent displays, the MicroLED offers finer pixel pitch (0.6mm), higher brightness, better color accuracy (DCI-P3 95%), and improved transparency with no bulky backlighting, enabling sleek, seamless integration.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Transparent MicroLED 0.6mm Display - Clear LED Screens UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Explore Transparent MicroLED 0.6mm for sleek, see-through LED displays. Available now in Dubai, UAE. Boost your visuals today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-trx060\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\